   "level": 3,
   "text": "What is a surd?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- A **surd** is the square root of a non-square integer\n- Using surds lets you leave answers in exact form\n\n  - e.g. $5\\sqrt{2}$  rather than $7.071067811...$"
  },
